Exercice 1 :
Build the modules :
 > make
Load the first module :
 > sudo insmod mydriver1.ko message_size=10
Load the second module :
 > sudo insmod mydriver2.ko
 > sudo dmesg -c
 AAAAAAAAAA
 > cat /sys/module/mydriver1/parameters/message_size
 10
 > sudo rmmod mydriver2
 > echo 2| sudo tee /sys/module/mydriver1/parameters/message
 > sudo insmod mydriver2.ko
 > sudo dmesg -c
 AAAAAAAAAA
 The parameter is not refreshed, why ? How to change the message size ?


